### Worked example of every endpoint. Use with the VS Code REST Client
### extension, or translate to curl. Base URL assumes local dev.

@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@companyId = salon-01

### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health

### Business info
GET {{base}}/business?companyId={{companyId}}

### Services (all)
GET {{base}}/services?companyId={{companyId}}

### Services (phone-bookable only)
GET {{base}}/services?companyId={{companyId}}&bookableOnly=true

### Stylists
GET {{base}}/stylists?companyId={{companyId}}

### Stylists who do highlights
GET {{base}}/stylists?companyId={{companyId}}&serviceId=svc_highlights

### Resolve a spoken date phrase
POST {{base}}/resolve-date
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyId": "salon-01", "phrase": "next Thursday" }

### Availability for a single date across all qualified stylists
GET {{base}}/availability?companyId={{companyId}}&serviceId=svc_haircut&date=2026-09-15

### Availability over a range, mornings only, one stylist
GET {{base}}/availability?companyId={{companyId}}&serviceId=svc_highlights&dateFrom=2026-09-15&dateTo=2026-09-20&stylistId=sty_priya&partOfDay=morning

### Availability for a service that is not phone-bookable -> 403
GET {{base}}/availability?companyId={{companyId}}&serviceId=svc_bridal&date=2026-09-15

### Create a booking (idempotent)
# @name createBooking
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001

{
  "companyId": "salon-01",
  "serviceId": "svc_haircut",
  "stylistId": "sty_ramesh",
  "date": "2026-09-16",
  "start": "11:00",
  "customer": { "name": "Meera", "phone": "9000000001", "email": "meera@example.com" },
  "notes": "First visit",
  "source": "voice_agent"
}

### Find bookings by phone
GET {{base}}/bookings/find?companyId={{companyId}}&phone=9000000001

### Send a confirmation
POST {{base}}/notifications/confirmation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyId": "salon-01", "bookingId": "REPLACE_WITH_bookingId", "channels": ["email", "sms"] }

### Reschedule a booking
POST {{base}}/bookings/REPLACE_WITH_bookingId/reschedule
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyId": "salon-01", "date": "2026-09-17", "start": "12:00", "stylistId": "sty_ramesh" }

### Cancel a booking
POST {{base}}/bookings/REPLACE_WITH_bookingId/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyId": "salon-01", "reason": "Caller cancelled by phone" }

### Escalation message
POST {{base}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyId": "salon-01", "category": "bridal", "name": "Meera", "phone": "9000000001", "note": "Wants bridal package for a December wedding" }

### Admin: bookings
GET {{base}}/admin/bookings?companyId={{companyId}}&status=confirmed

### Admin: open messages
GET {{base}}/admin/messages?companyId={{companyId}}&status=open

### Admin: add a block (holiday)
POST {{base}}/admin/blocks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyId": "salon-01", "stylistId": "sty_priya", "startAt": "2026-09-20T04:30:00.000Z", "endAt": "2026-09-20T14:30:00.000Z", "reason": "Priya on leave" }

### Admin: reset seed data
POST {{base}}/admin/seed?companyId={{companyId}}
